B.aSv=new A.dY("Introduction",'Welcome to Rumuo, operated by chAs Technologies LLC. By downloading or using this app, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). Please read them carefully. If you do not agree, do not use Rumuo.')
B.aSM=new A.dY("1. About Rumuo","Rumuo is a financial literacy content aggregator that curates videos, shorts, blogs, and books across 60 categories covering business skills, trades, and professions \u2014 built specifically to support entrepreneurs, business owners, and professionals across Africa and beyond. Content is sourced from publicly available channels, RSS feeds, and open-access resources.")
B.aSP=new A.dY("2. Use of the App","You may use Rumuo for personal, non-commercial purposes only. You agree not to:\n\n\u2022 Reproduce, distribute, or sell any content aggregated by Rumuo.\n\u2022 Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or tamper with the app.\n\u2022 Use the app for any unlawful or fraudulent purpose.\n\u2022 Scrape, harvest, or systematically extract content from the app.")
B.aSK=new A.dY("3. Content","Rumuo aggregates publicly available financial education content from YouTube and other sources. All video content, thumbnails, channel names, blog articles, and book references are the intellectual property of their respective creators and are subject to their own terms and licences.\n\nWe do not host, upload, or claim ownership of any third-party content displayed in the app. Rumuo accesses content via publicly available RSS feeds and open-access URLs in compliance with the respective platform's terms of service.")
B.aSy=new A.dY("4. Purchases & Payments","contact us using the details in Section 9 of our Privacy Policy.")
B.aSw=new A.dY("5. Intellectual Property","The Rumuo app \u2014 including its name, logo, design, original code, category taxonomy, and branding \u2014 is owned by chAs Technologies LLC and protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce or use our branding without prior written permission.")
B.aSL=new A.dY("6. Disclaimer of Warranties",'Rumuo is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We do not guarantee that the app will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of inaccuracies. Content availability depends on third-party sources that may change without notice. We make no representations about the accuracy or completeness of any aggregated content.')
B.aSJ=new A.dY("7. Limitation of Liability","To the maximum extent permitted by law, chAs Technologies LLC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, Rumuo \u2014 including any financial decisions made based on content viewed in the app.")
B.aSH=new A.dY("8. Termination","We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to Rumuo at any time, without notice, if we believe you have violated these Terms.")
B.aSr=new A.dY("9. Changes to These Terms","We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of Rumuo after changes take effect constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.")
B.aSO=new A.dY("10. Contact","For questions about these Terms, contact us at:\n\nchastechnologiesllc@gmail.com")
B.a4e=s([B.aSv,B.aSM,B.aSP,B.aSK,B.aSy,B.aSw,B.aSL,B.aSJ,B.aSH,B.aSr,B.aSO],t.HP)
